<section class="surfdoc-section">
<h1 id="the-backends-grammar">The backends grammar</h1>
<p>The stateful blocks a phone app needs (0.33.0): a record with an owner and a
computed field, a list route, a tiered picker, a stepped flow, a model-bound
form, a derived value, a conditional section and a reminder.</p>

<div class="surfdoc-infra-card surfdoc-model"><strong class="surfdoc-infra-label">Model: Entry</strong><table class="surfdoc-model-table"><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Constraints</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>uuid</code></td><td> <span class="surfdoc-model-constraints">[primary]</span></td></tr><tr><td><code>core</code></td><td><code>enum(Joy, Trust)</code></td><td> <span class="surfdoc-model-constraints">[required]</span></td></tr><tr><td><code>level</code></td><td><code>range</code></td><td> <span class="surfdoc-model-constraints">[min=1, max=10, labels=&quot;Barely felt it|All-consuming&quot;]</span></td></tr><tr><td><code>score</code></td><td><code>float</code> <span class="surfdoc-model-computed">= round(avg(level), 1)</span></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="surfdoc-infra-card surfdoc-route"><span class="surfdoc-route-method surfdoc-method-get">GET</span> <code class="surfdoc-route-path">/_api/Entry</code><ul><li>returns: <code>list(Entry)</code></li><li>filter: <code>date</code></li><li>sort: <code>date</code></li></ul></div>
<form class="surfdoc-form" method="post" action="/_api/Entry" data-model="Entry" data-steps="true"><input type="radio" name="_step" value="1" id="flow-step-1" class="surfdoc-form-step-radio" checked/><input type="radio" name="_step" value="2" id="flow-step-2" class="surfdoc-form-step-radio"/><div class="surfdoc-form-progress" style="--surfdoc-steps:2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="surfdoc-form-progress-bar"></span></div><fieldset class="surfdoc-form-step" data-step="1"><legend>Step 1 of 2 · Pick an emotion</legend><fieldset class="surfdoc-picker" data-bind="entry.core" data-tiers="2" data-layout="wheel" data-emoji="false"><div class="surfdoc-picker-row" data-core="Joy" data-info="Content | Seeing a friend"><label class="surfdoc-picker-choice"><input type="radio" name="entry.core" value="Serenity" data-tier="1"/>Serenity</label><label class="surfdoc-picker-choice"><input type="radio" name="entry.core" value="Joy" data-tier="2"/>Joy</label></div></fieldset><div class="surfdoc-form-step-nav"><label for="flow-step-2" class="surfdoc-form-step-next">Next</label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="surfdoc-form-step" data-step="2" data-repeat="true"><legend>Step 2 of 2 · Why?</legend><div class="surfdoc-form-field"><label>Note</label><textarea name="note" placeholder="What caused it?" rows="4" maxlength="500" data-sentences="1..4"></textarea></div><div class="surfdoc-form-step-nav"><label for="flow-step-1" class="surfdoc-form-step-prev">Previous</label><button type="submit" class="surfdoc-form-submit">Save</button></div></fieldset></form>
<form class="surfdoc-form" method="post" action="/_api/Entry" data-model="Entry"><div class="surfdoc-form-field"><label>Level</label><input type="range" name="level" min="1" max="10" step="1" data-levels="2|4|7|9"/><output class="surfdoc-form-range-value"></output></div><button type="submit" class="surfdoc-form-submit">Submit</button></form>
<output class="surfdoc-compute" data-compute-name="daily_score" data-compute-expr="avg(entries.level)" data-source="/_api/Entry"></output>
<section class="surfdoc-when" data-when-bind="day.score" data-when-op="&lt;=" data-when-value="-8" hidden><p>Reach out to someone you trust.</p>
</section>
<span class="surfdoc-schedule" data-schedule-bind="preference.reminder_time" data-schedule-tz="viewer" data-schedule-title="MoodMap" data-schedule-body="How are you feeling today?" data-schedule-link="/log" hidden></span>
</section>